ar you can be detected.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This enables stealth gameplay mechanics: equip a heat-sink and lower your heat signature to mask your signature for a limited time (but get too close and you will be detected!) at some point you have to vent your heat!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>11 Unique alien races:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with their own distinct manner of communication.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the enigmatic Coriantans to the aggressive V'Throni and invading U'Guul. The passive Noxu, the depressed Boolooloo &amp; more. Maintain cordial relations and they will assist you. Under attack? Send a distress call. Damaged? Ask for repairs. Disabled? Request a tow.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep exploration:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stable, Unstable, Ancient wormholes and sectors to be discovered and exploited. Unstable wormholes can be stabilised with the right technology, unlocking new sectors to exploit or new shortcuts across the sector.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabilise wormholes before entry. Some wormholes can<strong> <u>only</u></strong> be traversed by smaller support craft. Park your mothership, launch your runabout, go exploring and come back right where you left it, even if you leave the system! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/2d7109d4c9796aaa4200a8e4cf765b7f.poster.avif?t=1788222363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/2d7109d4c9796aaa4200a8e4cf765b7f.webm?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/2d7109d4c9796aaa4200a8e4cf765b7f.mp4?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crew simulation system:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your crew offers passive bonuses to various stats. They consume water and food (which you can craft from raw materials gathered while on long expeditions). You can send them on away missions to planets in a shuttle to gather materials for crafting. All in real-time, no abstraction.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support Ships</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to your pilot-able support craft, you can equip yourself with a suite of drones for mining, salvaging and repairing. Deploy them and continue exploring, they will return on completion. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/d4351cdf96fda9c6de21982773abc060.poster.avif?t=1788222363\" width=800 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/d4351cdf96fda9c6de21982773abc060.webm?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/d4351cdf96fda9c6de21982773abc060.mp4?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help Stranded Allies:  Tow stranded ships back to port.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/7b606e1f7bb8ad1bfb201d4521f8d593.poster.avif?t=1788222363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/7b606e1f7bb8ad1bfb201d4521f8d593.webm?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/7b606e1f7bb8ad1bfb201d4521f8d593.mp4?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ancient Wormholes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These phenomena can lead to dark sectors, where the only light you have is what you bring with you. There are things in the darkness which don't like the light.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/7dc443023c1183a5b4fe147befca3805.poster.avif?t=1788222363\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/7dc443023c1183a5b4fe147befca3805.webm?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/7dc443023c1183a5b4fe147befca3805.mp4?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> <br><br><strong>Prepare For A Fight:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/2daaca17e034ccd290fc98ee72822ff6.poster.avif?t=1788222363\" width=800 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/2daaca17e034ccd290fc98ee72822ff6.webm?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4941160/extras/2daaca17e034ccd290fc98ee72822ff6.mp4?t=1788222363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the sector:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster